# Flowbite UI

Use the `flowbite` package for new and updated Vue UI.

- Style forms, buttons, alerts, dropdowns, modals, and tabs with Flowbite Tailwind classes.
- Reuse helpers from `resources/js/flowbite.js` (`fbInput`, `fbButton`, `fbLabel`, `fbLink`, `fbAlertSuccess`, `fbCheckbox`).
- Keep ERP teal (`teal-700` / brand `#0f766e`), not default Flowbite blue.
- Interactive widgets (`data-dropdown-toggle`, modal, tooltip) rely on `bootFlowbite()` after Inertia navigation. Do not skip `initFlowbite`.
- Support `dark:` variants. Theme uses both `data-theme="dark"` and the `dark` class on `<html>`.
- Support RTL with logical classes (`ms-`, `me-`, `ps-`, `pe-`, `start`, `end`).
- Do not mix Bootstrap `form-control` / `btn-erp` on pages already migrated to Flowbite.
- Do not add `flowbite-vue` unless explicitly requested; this project uses `flowbite` + Vue templates.
